Render notes
------------

Static (no .tpl): copied byte-for-byte; not substitution-scanned. The SKILL.md
and references/*.md files here are static so literal token names (e.g.
`color_brand`) survive verbatim, as are `theme/theme.tokens.json` and
`theme/README.md` (literal CSS-variable names like `--primary` and `oklch(...)`
must survive). Rendered files (`.tpl`, scanned for `${...}` managed paths):
`README.md.tpl`, and under `theme/`: `globals.css.tpl` (only `${project.name}`
in its leading comment is substituted — every OKLch token VALUE is a static
default, because an unbound `${...}` is a hard render error) and
`components.json.tpl` (static; valid JSON after render). Token keys are snake_case
`^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$` (decision O4) so the lowercase render regex never leaves a
hyphenated key un-substituted.
